.TH ZAPRET-GUI 1 "October 2026" "zapret-gui" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
zapret-gui \- graphical frontend for zapret-discord-youtube-linux
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zapret-gui
[\fB\-\-minimized\fR] [\fB\-\-version\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B zapret-gui
controls zapret-discord-youtube-linux: selects a strategy, network interface,
GameFilter and firewall backend, starts and stops zapret, manages the
autostart service, edits user host lists and runs strategy auto-tuning in a
built-in terminal. A tray icon shows the current state.
.PP
On first launch the program offers to download zapret-discord-youtube-linux
into \fI~/zapret-discord-youtube-linux\fR.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-minimized
Start hidden in the system tray.
.TP
.B \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/zapret-gui/settings.json
GUI settings.
.TP
.I ~/.cache/zapret-gui/run.log
Output of the last zapret run started from the GUI.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sudo (8),
.BR nft (8)
